f_standards_v1.1.xls\">Link to an entry in file-system</a>\n</p>\n<a href=\"/node/149141\">Community to Collection creates a redirect and transforms the link into D8 collection alias</a>\n\n<a href=\"/community/edp/description\">Alias to Community that creates a  Collection, creates a redirect and transforms the link into D8 collection alias</a>\n\n<a href=\"/node/150255\">Community Content canonical link is transformed into the alias of the D8 aliased path</a>\n\n<a href=\"/asset/cpsv-ap/event/cpsv-ap-revision-wg-virtual-meeting-0\">Alias of Community Content is preserving the NID and changes the link into the D8 alias</a>\n\n<a href=\"/user/6481\">User canonical link is transformed into the alias of the D8 aliased path</a>\n\n<a href=\"/people/6481\">User alias is transformed into user D8 alias</a>\n\n<a href=\"/node/20226\">User \'content\' profile node is transformed into user D8 alias</a>\n\n<a href=\"/profile/afalciano-profile\">Alias of user \'content\' profile node is transformed into user D8 alias</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/asset/core_location/issue/related-work-open-geospatial-consortium#some-fragment\">An absolute link to a migrated Discussion with fragment</a>\n\n<img alt=\"An absolute link to a Drupal managed file which was not migrated\" src=\"https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/e3/0c/57/MDR_logo.png\" />\n\n<a href=https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/ISA_Programme_ADMS_Brochure.pdf>An absolute link to Drupal unmanaged file which was not migrated</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/svn/adms/grefine_rdf/ADMS_v1.00_Spreadsheet_Template_v0.35.xls\" target=\"_blank\">An absolute link to an unmigrated \'svn/\' file resource</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://joinup.ec.europa.eu/site/dcat_application_profile/GeoDCAT-AP/GeoDCAT-AP_2015-04-15_2nd_WG_Virtual_Meeting/GeoDCAT-AP_2015-04-15_2nd_WG_Virtual_Meeting-minutes_v0.05.pdf\">An absolute link to an unmigrated \'site/\' file resource</a>\n\n<p><strong>Last update:</strong>&nbsp;June, 2016</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The current state of play of recommended / mandatory ICT standards and specifications is as follows:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<strong>468 standards&nbsp;</strong>in total are mandatory or recommended in&nbsp;<strong>at least 1 country</strong></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<strong>167 standards</strong>&nbsp;in total are mandatory or recommended in&nbsp;<strong>at least 2 countries</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This overlap illustrates the efforts made by Member States and EFTA countries, and signals the scope for sharing and reuse of the assessments and lists of mandatory/ recommended ICT standards and specifications.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The pie chart below provides a more detailed graphical overview:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/sites/default/files/ckeditor_files/images/chart.png\" style=\"width: 568px; height: 490px;\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The full list of standards and technical specifications can be found in <em>.xsl</em> format <u><a href=\"https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/list_of_standards_v1.1.xls\">here</a></u> and <em>.ods</em> format <u><a href=\"https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/list_of_standards_v1.1.ods\">here</a></u>.</p>\r\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:438px;\" width=\"438\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td height=\"50\" style=\"width: 102px; border-width: 0px 1px 0px 5px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 140, 229); border-left-style: solid; background-color: rgb(0, 100, 163); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-right-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-right-style: solid; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;\">\r\n				<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(0, 100, 163);\">Standard</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"border-width: 0px 1px 0px 0px; background-color: rgb(0, 100, 163); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-right-color: rgb(255,