ill assess the need for updating the EUPL: more interoperability and innovative ideas are welcome!\r\n\r\nFor more information: an overview on the EUPL and its impact was presented on 29 March 2012 at the 2nd OSEPA conference in Jihlava (Czech Republic)\r\nhttp://joinup.ec.europa.eu/community/eupl/news/eupl-will-licence-be-updated\r\n',0),(9227,28,'digital information exchange','',0),(9228,28,'services directive','',0),(9229,28,'syndication','',0),(9230,28,'eDocuments','',0),(9231,28,'e-documents','',0),(9232,28,'eDelivery','',0),(9233,28,'e-delivery','',0),(9234,28,'eSafe','',0),(9235,28,'e-safe','',0),(9236,28,'cross border','',0),(9237,28,'LSP','',0),(9238,28,'MIDB','',0),(9239,28,'TSL','',0),(9240,28,'single point of contact','',0),(9241,28,'large-scale pilot project','',0),(9242,28,'OpenDays','',0),(9244,28,'assessment report','',0),(9245,28,'DS-XML','',0),(9246,28,'Application Interoperability','',0),(9247,10,'Cartella Socio Sanitaria (Social welfare and healthcare data Folder)','',0),(9248,28,'proyectos','',0),(9249,28,'FunOS','',0),(9250,28,'DIVERTIDO','',0),(9251,10,'SPOCS Slovenian Pilot Application','',0),(9252,28,'ATC','',0),(9253,28,'123456','',0),(9254,28,'damohand','',0),(9255,28,'respiratory','',0),(9257,64,'Reminder','',0),(9258,28,'linked open vocabularies','',0),(9259,28,'HIVE','',0),(9260,28,'SKOS-2-HIVE','',0),(9261,28,'for all','',0),(9262,28,'needed','',0),(9263,28,'hola','',0),(9264,28,'Linked Data Platform Working Group','',0),(9265,28,'LDP','',0),(9266,28,'Linked Data Basic Profile','',0),(9267,28,'jgrasstools','',0),(9268,28,'udig','',0),(9269,28,'geopaparazzi','',0),(9270,28,'qwe123rty','',0),(9271,28,'qwe123rtu','',0),(9272,28,'VAT','',0),(9273,28,'software metadata','',0),(9274,28,'software projects','',0),(9275,28,'XHTML','',0),(9276,28,'HTML; RDF Web Applications','',0),(9277,28,'quatourze','',0),(9278,28,'enterprise solutions','',0),(9279,28,'virtualisation','',0),(9280,28,'Wetu GIT','',0),(9281,28,'chile','',0),(9282,28,'polo','',0)